  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-6375 Effectively Managing Networks of Marine Protected Areas in Large Marine Ecosystems in ASEAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop and improve the management of ecological networks of marine protected areas and marine corridors within selected Large Marine Ecosystems (LMEs) in the ASEAN region to increase MPA coverage, better conserve globally significant biodiversity and support sustainable fisheries and other ecosystem goods and services in these LMEs</narrative>
